{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/n10' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/n10' data-title='10'>\r\n\t\t\t10\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Flat login-screen colour with DisableLogonBackgroundImage, Theme colour, or desk.cpl Advanced.","label":"Personalize","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/interactive_service","label":"Interactive service","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/interactive_service"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/start_menu","label":"Start menu","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/start_menu"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Login screen background<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSee [how to change the login screen background on Windows 10](http:\/\/www.howtogeek.com\/223875\/how-to-change-the-login-screen-background-on-windows-10\/).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\System<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCreate DWORD <code class='inline'>DisableLogonBackgroundImage<\/code> = <code class='inline'>1<\/code>. Delete it or set it to <code class='inline'>0<\/code> to revert.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThis displays a flat colour. To change the colour, use <strong>Personalize &gt; Theme colour<\/strong>, or:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>rundll32.exe shell32.dll,Control_RunDLL desk.cpl,Advanced,@Advanced<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/personalize\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/personalize\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/interactive_service' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/interactive_service' data-title='Interactive service' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Interactive service<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/start_menu' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/n10\/start_menu' data-title='Start menu' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Start menu<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/n10' data-target='computer\/os\/wind